"{\"url\":\"https://www.microcision.com/copy-of-finishing-operator\",\"title\":\"Quality Control CMM Programmer | Microcision\",\"desc\":null,\"og\":null,\"robots\":null,\"imgs\":[\"Microcision logo.png | 31e942_ef154a865afe4fa79723417987ebbaeb~mv2.png\"],\"form\":[],\"iframes\":[],\"sha256\":\"a1b85aaafde1ee46a4ae68f170a52926ffbdd1cdf4b34724e4708d90c5b877de\",\"text\":\"Skip to Main Content\\n\\nHOME\\n\\nSERVICES\\n\\nABOUT\\n\\nEXPANSION\\n\\nCAREERS\\n\\nCONTACT\\n\\nQuality Control CMM Programmer / Operator\\n\\n\\u00a0\\n\\nPrimary duties and responsibilities include:\\n\\n\\u00a0\\n\\nProgram set-up and operate CMM and Optical measuring machines.\\n\\nSet-up CMM inspection for other operators / shifts.\\n\\nPerform first piece, in process, and final inspection of machined parts.\\n\\nAssist machine programmers and set-up personnel to optimize both milling and screw machine set-up time and machine utilization.\\n\\nTrain personnel to operate CMM and Optical measuring machines.\\n\\nCompletion of internal and customer required quality documentation.\\n\\n\\u00a0\\n\\nCandidate shall meet the following requirements:\\n\\n\\u00a0\\n\\n(3) years minimum CMM programming and operational experience (B & S / Hexagon PC DMIS preferred). Alternate CMM experience will be considered.\\n\\nOptical Measuring device experience (OGP, Keyence, Nikon or similar).\\n\\nBackground in Quality/Mechanical Engineering a plus\\n\\nBackground in Geometric Dimensioning & Tolerancing,\\n\\nSPC (MiniTab) experience a plus.\\n\\nCapability to use all standard measuring tools such as optical comparators calipers, micrometers, go/no-go and thread gauges, surface plate instruments.\\n\\nAble to use a computer and have a working knowledge of Microsoft Office.\\n(Outlook / Excel / Word / Power Point / Visio)\\n\\nAbility to multi-task and be flexible in a fast-paced manufacturing environment.\\n\\nBasic understanding of any of the following: ISO-13485:2016 , ISO 9001:2015 , TS16949, AS9100C,\\u00a0 21CFR820 quality systems.\\n\\n\\u00a0\\n\\nHours- 1st shift or 2nd \\u00a0shift\\n\\nSwing shift 10:00 am to 8:30 pm available.\\n\\n\\nWe offer a competitive salary, medical and dental insurance, 401k, overtime, and advancement. EOE.\\n\\n\\u00a9 2022\\u00a0by Microcision LLC\"}"
